<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Premium Collection & Receipting</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Master the financial complexity of insurance through flexible multi-tender collection 
            engines, automated commission management, and rigorous premium accountability.
        </p>
    </div>
