<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Multi-Currency & Multi-Tender Receipting</h2>
        <p>
            Operating in Zimbabwe requires extreme financial flexibility. Our Premium Collection 
            module supports native multi-currency invoicing and receipting in both USD and 
            ZiG. Payments can be recorded across multiple tenders—including mobile money 
            (EcoCash), bank transfers, and credit cards—with every transaction 
            immediately generating a ZIMRA-compliant fiscal receipt. This 
            level of financial integrity protects the organization from reconciliation 
            errors and ensures seamless regulatory tax compliance.
        </p>
        <p>
            "Premium-in-Suspense" management allows for the recording of payments where 
            the final policy allocation is pending, ensuring that every cent entering 
            the organization is accounted for from day one.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Sophisticated Payment & Instalment Plans</h2>
        <p>
            Improve client retention and accessibility by offering flexible payment structures. 
            Define and manage complex insurance instalment plans, with automated invoicing 
            triggered on payment due dates. The system monitors payment discipline, 
            flagging overdue accounts for immediate follow-up or automated cover 
            suspension in accordance with policy terms and IPEC regulations.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated Intermediary Commission</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate commission disputes with brokers and agents. The system automatically 
            calculates due commission on the receipting of every premium cent, according 
            to the specific commission schedules configured for each intermediary and 
            product class. Comprehensive commission statements are generated 
            monthly, facilitating transparent and rapid reconciliation with your 
            distribution partners.
        </p>
        <p>
            Native integration with the ERP's Accounts Payable module ensures that 
            authorized commission payments are processed accurately, maintaining 
            strong commercial relationships with your most productive brokers.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

